{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_013kys_2_1_8_013_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:932cc9780790b1beca93977fb1add93b1bf97a72fc2b326e2280526e1387e97b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_013kys_2_1_8_013_02:1_8_013_02:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac2c4b83726012150961c37c58726379d33443410f4b66b9b0654dddb99ae92",
      "text": "啊，监督。辛苦了！悠介刚才\n出去了，不过应该很快就会回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_013kys_2_1_8_013_02:1_8_013_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fbc5f2955b077a517e3f93437df4ce836b5695dde5c914842ee676bb2e3002e",
      "text": "对了，趁悠介回来之前，我有话想跟你说。\n●●●●●●●●●●监督，祝你生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_013kys_2_1_8_013_02:1_8_013_02:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:115925b215148de4b14d5e00b32fa6282ac5499f4b82c49e009ef79bcd20db12",
      "text": "谢谢您，享介先生！\n突然送上祝福，吓了我一跳……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_013kys_2_1_8_013_02:1_8_013_02:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61bab2f3a8f581a304a5768583f7b6bae65367353ac1aea4a2aa64370407f4c0",
      "text": "大意了吧？为了吓监督一跳，\n我和悠介商量了好久呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_013kys_2_1_8_013_02:1_8_013_02:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90b2eace3295719701ffb87f414b25f77b6fc7cdb974c19ff8efd7fcf8c4b4c9",
      "text": "等工作结束了，当然还要和悠介两个人\n好好给你大肆庆祝一番哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
